    "page2": "https://bloxodes.com/wiki/red-dead-redemption-2/animals/page/2",
    "method": "Bloxodes animal-specific entries and group table are used where available. The missing Compendium species are supplemented with species-level clean-kill notes and animal-size guidance from the listed guides. Entries with no sensible clean-kill target are explicitly listed in noRecommendationEntries instead of receiving guessed weapon advice.",
    "note": "For some runtime species, the guide groups multiple Compendium variants. Those unions are called out in modelNote rather than silently claiming the game can distinguish the variants.",
